{"title":"Frogs","slug":"Frogs","hero":null,"pageid":5120,"revid":22045,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T23:59:59Z","lastEditor":"Ilovechocolateyk","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"places","text":"Places"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Frogs are a passive mob that can be found in different places around the Oaklands map, some of them spawn exclusively in these places and others can be found in multiple places. \n</p><p>The only way to catch a Frog is by using the Bug Net or the Bug Catcher 3000, which are purchasable in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Flora_Laura/\">Flora Laura</a> Shop. If successfully caught a frog, they will transform into a draggable item and will stop making a croaking sound. Frogs aren't meant for Butterfly cages, but for some reason Gray Tree Frog can be put in it at this moment (31.05.26-12.07.26).\n</p><p>In the version v121.0, companions have been added. Frogs can now be equipped as little mascots, and players can give them unique names. The Frog will follow you around and make croaking sounds, but of course you can mute it. <i>Some frogs have a perk/effect.</i>\n</p><p>Frogs can be sold in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Resource_Hub/\">Resource Hub</a> depending on their type. \n</p><p><big><i>(If you found a different type - please add it here.)</i></big>\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"places\">Places</h2>\n<h3 id=\"ferwater\">Ferwater</h3>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Rarity\n</th>\n<th>Effect\n</th>\n<th>Price\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gray Tree Frog\n</td>\n<td>Common\n</td>\n<td>None\n</td>\n<td>$200\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: GrayTreeFrog\">GrayTreeFrog</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Souther